# Binaries and executables
# NOTE: patterns must target the compiled binary *files*, not source directories.
# Bare names like `**/setagaya`, `**/ingress-controller`, `**/*-controller` also
# match the source directories, which makes `git add setagaya/...` fail and broke
# Dependabot's Go module updates ("paths are ignored by one of your .gitignore").
*.exe
*/setagaya-*
setagaya/setagaya
ingress-controller/sic
ingress-controller/ingress-controller
local_storage/storage
local_storage/v0
bin/golangci-lint

# Go build artifacts
*/coverage.out
*/coverage.html
**/go.sum~
**/go.mod~

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp
